From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:49:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vs995: drop the dead libbinder-v32 dependency from
 libkeystore_binder

Soong on 24.0:

  vendor/lge/msm8996-common/Android.bp:78:1: "libkeystore_binder" depends on
      undefined module "libbinder-v32"

libbinder-v32 is a VNDK-32 shim that hardware/lineage/compat used to provide. On lineage-24.0 upstream
removed both the module and the prebuilt .so from that repo, while keeping the siblings this device also
wants -- libhidlbase-v32, libutils-v33 and libprotobuf-cpp-lite-v29 are all still there. So this is one
retired shim, not VNDK going away.

libkeystore_binder is a prebuilt, so shared_libs only orders Soong's dependencies; it does not change
what the .so links against at runtime, which is whatever DT_NEEDED it was built with in 2017. Dropping
the reference is therefore the narrow fix.

Deliberately not deleting the blob: something else in this vendor set may load it, and that would only
show up at runtime. Nor pinning hardware/lineage/compat back to 22.2, which would rewind every other
shim on the branch to get one .so back.

---
 Android.bp | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 7db749e..8cce851 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -84,11 +84,11 @@ cc_prebuilt_library_shared {
 	target: {
 		android_arm: {
 			srcs: ["proprietary/system/lib/libkeystore_binder.so"],
-			shared_libs: ["libbinder-v32", "liblog", "libprotobuf-cpp-lite-v29", "libutils", "libhwbinder", "libhidlbase", "android.hardware.keymaster@3.0", "libc++", "libdl", "libc", "libm", ],
+			shared_libs: ["liblog", "libprotobuf-cpp-lite-v29", "libutils", "libhwbinder", "libhidlbase", "android.hardware.keymaster@3.0", "libc++", "libdl", "libc", "libm", ],
 		},
 		android_arm64: {
 			srcs: ["proprietary/system/lib64/libkeystore_binder.so"],
-			shared_libs: ["libbinder-v32", "liblog", "libprotobuf-cpp-lite-v29", "libutils", "libhwbinder", "libhidlbase", "android.hardware.keymaster@3.0", "libc++", "libdl", "libc", "libm", ],
+			shared_libs: ["liblog", "libprotobuf-cpp-lite-v29", "libutils", "libhwbinder", "libhidlbase", "android.hardware.keymaster@3.0", "libc++", "libdl", "libc", "libm", ],
 		},
 	},
 	compile_multilib: "both",
